  "title": "Visual Naming EC",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG recordings from 110 individuals who performed a visual-naming task, with electrode coordinates provided in MNI-305 space. It was collected to support analyses of effective connectivity underlying speech and language processing, as reported by Kochi et al. (2025). Each recording is annotated with event codes marking stimulus and response onsets.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded from 110 subjects performing a visual-naming task. Each EDF file includes event codes marking stimulus onset (401) and response onset (501). Electrode coordinates were localized in MNI-305 standardized space.",
